  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women Economic Empowerment Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim of this project is to build building women&apos;s social, human, financial and physical capital for sustainable livelihoods among vulnerable female headed households in Mansa district (Luapula province) and Monze district  (southern Province). This will be achieved through targeting vulnerable female headed households in target areas by increasing production, productivity and access to quality food as well as increase in household incomes. The project also aims to strengthen the capacity of the existing community structures, including the church (and the individuals in those structures) in addressing gender inequality by promoting gender equality and rights of women and young female/youths.</narrative>
  </description>
